\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Love divine, all loves excelling,
\par Joy of heaven, to earth come down;
\par Fix in us Thy faithful mercies crown:
\par All Thy faithful mercies crown:
\par Jesus, Thou art all compassion,
\par Pure, unbounded love Thou art;
\par Visit us with Thy salvation,
\par Enter every trembling heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, almighty to deliver,
\par Let us all Thy grace receives;
\par Suddenly return, and never,
\par Never more Thy temples leave:
\par Thee we would be always blessing,
\par Serve Thee as Thy host above,
\par Pray, and praise Thee, without ceasing,
\par Glory in Thy perfect love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Finish then Thy new creation,
\par Pure and spotless let us be;
\par Let us see Thy great salvation, 
\par Perfectly restored in Thee;
\par Changed from glory into glory,
\par Till in heaven we take our place,
\par Till we cast our crowns before Thee,
\par Lost in wonder, love, and praise.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

